The project is developed in structured phases to ensure quality and maintainability.

### Phase 1: Backend Foundation (✅ COMPLETED)
**Goal**: Basic backend infrastructure with authentication

**Deliverables**:
- ✅ Node.js + Express server setup
- ✅ MongoDB connection configured
- ✅ User and Profile models created
- ✅ JWT authentication implemented
- ✅ Auth endpoints (register, login)
- ✅ Profile endpoints (CRUD operations)
- ✅ Middleware (auth, validation, error handling)
- ✅ Docker configuration

**Files Created**:
- [backend/server.js](mdc:backend/server.js)
- [backend/config/db.js](mdc:backend/config/db.js)
